    HP), enormously boosts max HP, enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, hugely
    boosts own Atk, Def, Rec for 5 turns, hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative to
    max HP for 3 turns & enormously boosts BB gauge for 3 turns
